      "cooked": "<p>Sure, here it is:</p><p>![Here should have been a tile-picture](upload://IMGx3Mm3qunJnV6UeuNm9EXORr.jpeg)</p><p>This is kind of a bland example using a printscreen from google maps, but in essence you can insert any picture underneath the grid. After that it is just a matter of adjusting the dots.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5dabcb1b3a7dcced72bd1293debd9d7292bac823.png\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/5dabcb1b3a7dcced72bd1293debd9d7292bac823\" title=\"Paris-Eiffeltower_3.png\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5dabcb1b3a7dcced72bd1293debd9d7292bac823_2_462x500.png\" alt=\"Paris-Eiffeltower_3.png\" data-base62-sha1=\"dmEta8Ilti6EVOzczaPSx1JUajN\" width=\"462\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5dabcb1b3a7dcced72bd1293debd9d7292bac823_2_462x500.png, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5dabcb1b3a7dcced72bd1293debd9d7292bac823.png 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5dabcb1b3a7dcced72bd1293debd9d7292bac823.png 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5dabcb1b3a7dcced72bd1293debd9d7292bac823_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Paris-Eiffeltower_3.png</span><span class=\"informations\">466×504 372 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
